    "body": "Good point. I don't precisely remember, but I think we wanted to ensure that it was easily extensible with new codecs. However, using an enum wouldn't really make any difference to that.\r\n\r\nWe might also want to include compression parameters as part of the `format`, but I can't think of any parameters that wouldn't be better placed in a second \"option bag\" argument to the constructor.",
